    "title": "Gayle King Has a Bonkers Cheating Story for You - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 hours ago I will be thinking about Gayle King catching her (now) ex-husband, William Bumpus, “boinking around” with her (now) ex-friend for the rest of my life. King appeared on Call Her Daddy on Wednesday and spent a sizable chunk of the interview talking about this incident in visceral detail. Though she has mentioned it before — in a 2016 Vanity Fair interview she quipped, “I’m not a huge fan of the woman I caught naked with my now ex-husband on June 24, 1990, at 9:16 p.m.” — she has never painted quite as clear a picture as she did on CHD. We thank her for her service. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
